                "text": "On #ForefathersDay, we pay tribute to the trailblazers who fought for freedom and forged the American spirit. Great Montanans like Jeannette Rankin, Thomas Meagher, Chief Joseph Medicine Crow and others whose names we will never know made Montana the Last Best Place.",
