                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I got to tour RestorEar with the CEO Curtis King. His company makes a non pharmaceutical medical device that uses cold therapy to prevent hearing loss specifically for our military and first responders. He and his company are doing great work here in Gallatin County! Bravo Zulu",
