                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I welcomed executive leadership from Philips Healthcare to Helena to meet with VA leadership and tour the facility. The purpose of the visit is to better understand rural health delivery for our veterans and how medical devices could innovate to better serve them.\u00a0\u00a0Also have visits to Browning and Kalispell lined up to get a full picture.",
