                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Toured Life Flight facilities in Missoula yesterday. Recently the VA attempted to all-but-eliminate air ambulance coverage for veterans experiencing medical emergencies. I was able to halt that decision, keeping lifesaving resources like Life Flight available to veterans and our communities at large. Thank you to the professionals who make Montana safer!",
                "text_lang": "en",
