                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "@SuptHedalen nominated me for the #SpeakYourMind Ice Bucket Challenge to raise awareness about mental health and suicide prevention. Montana has one of the highest suicide rates in the nation, and our veteran population is disproportionately affected. This is a crisis we cannot ignore.\n\nLast Congress, I introduced the Protecting Veteran Community Care Act to ensure veterans can access life-saving mental health care in their local communities through the VA. I\u2019ll be reintroducing that legislation in the 119th Congress, but legislation alone isn\u2019t enough.",
