                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "1 down, 11 to go. Last night on the appropriations committee we passed the veterans affairs and military construction funding bill. \u00a0Wins include:\n\n\u2705 My bill language protecting vets\u2019 access to air ambulance\n\u2705 Full VA health care & benefits funding, increased by $20m\n\u2705 Base hardening in the Indo-Pacific to counter Chinese aggression\n\u2705 Blocking the VA from sourcing products in China\n\u2705 Protecting vets\u2019 2A rights",
                "text_lang": "en",
